<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Hills Industries year net up 1.5 pct.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Hills Industries year net up 1.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to June 30</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    20.77 vs 19.53</p>
<p>    Net				     12.22 vs 12.04</p>
<p>    Final dividend (cents)	    14.00 vs 12.00</p>
<p>    Sales				  338.72 vs 300.95</p>
<p>NOTE: Hills Industries Ltd is a manufacturer and distributor of metal prodcuts and electrical equipment.  </p>
<p>    Total dividend (cents)	     36.0  vs 23.0</p>
<p>    Other income			    8.28 vs  6.25</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)			    58.1  vs 57.2</p>
<p>    Abnormal items			 nil   vs  nil</p>
<p>Dividend is franked at 36 percent.</p>
<p>Pay date Nov 22</p>
<p>Reg date Nov 8</p>
<p>    Tax					7.18 vs  6.08</p>
<p>    Interest				 3.35 vs  2.73</p>
<p>    Depreciation			   7.94 vs  7.72</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 373 1800</p>
